  "jo.*: same, against _ref/jo-phase2-8958e49.html. Replace grep regions with exact markers as each",
  "review pack is built. Kinds: W01-W07 Jo live = -mb, ours = -oc; W09-W17 Jo live = plain, ours = -mb.",
